{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":26810,"ns":0,"title":"Skepticism","extract":"Skepticism (US) or scepticism (UK) is a questioning attitude or doubt toward knowledge claims that are seen as mere belief or dogma. For example, if a person is skeptical about claims made by their government about an ongoing war then the person doubts that these claims are accurate.","description":"Doubtful attitude toward knowledge claims","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}